{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits: Music composed by Esko V\u00e4h\u00e4m\u00e4ki and sound effects made by Ali Hosseini. Thank you for the great production!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A journey through death, accompanied by flowers and melodies.&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a spiritual embalmer in this realm between the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the gravestones by typing the names of the deceased on computer keyboards. Unravel their past stories and settle their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing is the main interaction, move with WASD and mouse for rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~20mins experience. Interactive graves are marked with colorful flower petals.\u00a0The rest are only for reading. The graveyard can shift between three worlds: the living, the between, and the dead. Players can puzzle up the deceased's stories across these worlds, and bring a meaningful item to their graves as an act of mourning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a solo production from 2022 to 2024. The instruction part is still a bit shaky; I will try to fix it next year. Before that, there is an interaction walkthrough video attached in the manual, enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first part of a series of graveyard games and is therefore free. The later ones will explore different cultural backgrounds and mourning practices.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422090?t=1759595391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759595391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422090/95357ef672fdf0fc4b792381245c5f22662239cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759595391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422090/95357ef672fdf0fc4b792381245c5f22662239cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759595391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits: Music composed by Esko V\u00e4h\u00e4m\u00e4ki and sound effects made by Ali Hosseini. Thank you for the great production!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A journey through death, accompanied by flowers and melodies.&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a spiritual embalmer in this realm between the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the gravestones by typing the names of the deceased on computer keyboards. Unravel their past stories and settle their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing is the main interaction, move with WASD and mouse for rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~20mins experience. Interactive graves are marked with colorful flower petals.\u00a0The rest are only for reading. The graveyard can shift between three worlds: the living, the between, and the dead. Players can puzzle up the deceased's stories across these worlds, and bring a meaningful item to their graves as an act of mourning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a solo production from 2022 to 2024. The instruction part is still a bit shaky; I will try to fix it next year. Before that, there is an interaction walkthrough video attached in the manual, enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first part of a series of graveyard games and is therefore free. The later ones will explore different cultural backgrounds and mourning practices.</p>","developers":["Bingxiao Luo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422090/header.jpg?t=1759595391","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> both<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422090/803671/dbf7b321567dac5ae483f0d625e0d249e8d917d7/1750849379/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744709465","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422090/803671/dbf7b321567dac5ae483f0d625e0d249e8d917d7/1750849379/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744709465","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3422090/803671/dbf7b321567dac5ae483f0d625e0d249e8d917d7/1750849379/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744709465","id":257084311,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084311/movie480.mp4?t=1744709465","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084311/movie_max.mp4?t=1744709465"},"name":"BETWEEN Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257084311/3b6c5c7fd79f3786c98bd157389afdf2f4c00427/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744709465","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084311/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744709465","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile